WEBVTT

00:00:01.038 --> 00:00:09.286
This is the Session step. Type the patient ID and press Next: the session starts, and is saved into the chosen BIDS folder.

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:17.858
In Indication and devices, choose the DBS indication. The target, the leads and the IPG are set here too.

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:29.227
The initial assessment documents how the patient arrives. Set the stimulation of each side, and tap the contacts on the lead: once for an anode, twice for a cathode.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:35.931
Then the clinical scores, and a note on how the patient presents. Next saves the initial assessment.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:54.890
In Programming, change one thing at a time, rate the symptoms and side effects, note how the patient responds, and press Save configuration.

00:01:11.925 --> 00:01:20.022
Each saved configuration is added to the charts and to the table below, where it can be starred, edited or deleted.

